WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.263
Read the pose like a language: left foot striding forward, fists clenched at the sides, gaze fixed on the horizon.

00:00:10.263 --> 00:00:15.305
Nothing moves, yet everything suggests controlled power.

00:00:15.305 --> 00:00:19.176
Crowns, beard, and headdress name the rank.

00:00:19.176 --> 00:00:28.000
For three thousand years, this stillness meant the same thing — a king, doing his eternal duty.

